<div data-language-panel="en">
  <section class="section proposal-intro" aria-labelledby="welcome-en">
    <div class="proposal-intro__copy">
      <p class="proposal-kicker">Slow travel, locally rooted</p>
      <h2 id="welcome-en">A village stay shaped by place</h2>
      <p>Mandirgarh brings together a seasonal waterbody, open scrub, farmland, woodland edges and old sacred places within a walkable landscape. The proposed pilot is for travellers who value patient observation, simple hospitality and respectful encounters with local life.</p>
      <p>One group of up to four adults would stay at a time. Local meals, guided walks and practical arrangements would be planned around the season and the host community’s capacity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="proposal-facts" aria-label="Experience highlights">
      <div><span class="fact-icon fact-icon--people" aria-hidden="true"></span><em>Guests</em><strong>1–4</strong><span>adults per group</span></div>
      <div><span class="fact-icon fact-icon--compass" aria-hidden="true"></span><em>Experiences</em><strong>3</strong><span>guided trail themes</span></div>
      <div><span class="fact-icon fact-icon--home" aria-hidden="true"></span><em>Community</em><strong>Local</strong><span>hosting, food and guiding</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

